(rails over RPMh with the live-DT voltages, reset gpio120, MCLK0 19.2 MHz), CCI0 M0 chip-ID read of
register 0x0016 (expected 0x0789), vendor power-down order. negroni_rpmh.c: negroni_rpmh_cam_rail
(whitelisted rails, enable=0 off command). Details: patches/xnu/README-camera.md.

